堅実ではあると思うから…
I think it's definitely solid, so...

1446
01:16:45,139 --> 01:16:48,739
これをもうちょい多めに… 今いくら持ってるんじゃ、わし？
Put a bit more on this... How much do I have left anyway?

1447
01:16:48,939 --> 01:16:51,439
わしの所持金いくらかわかんないや。
I don't even know what my balance is.

1448
01:16:59,739 --> 01:17:02,239
5万でかいか… 5万でかいか、ちょっと。
Is 50,000 too big? 50,000 is a bit much...

1449
01:17:02,739 --> 01:17:05,439
当たってもマイナス？当たってもマイナスなんてあんの？！
A loss even if it hits? Can you lose money even if you win?!

1450
01:17:13,239 --> 01:17:15,139
プラスにしたい！
I want to make a profit!

1451
01:17:15,739 --> 01:17:18,239
マイナス？これマイナスなの？！
A loss? This will end up as a loss?!

1452
01:17:25,339 --> 01:17:27,439
それがさっきそれなのか。
Is that what happened earlier?

1453
01:17:31,739 --> 01:17:33,439
えー、どうしようかなぁ。
Hmm, what should I do?

1454
01:17:34,639 --> 01:17:37,939
4万ぐらい… 4万ぐらいは、4万ぐらい。
About 40,000... around 40,000, yeah, about 40,000.

1455
01:17:39,839 --> 01:17:41,439
元取れなきゃダメ？
Does it have to break even?

1456
01:17:41,739 --> 01:17:43,639
元取れなきゃ意味ないか…
There's no point if I don't break even, I guess...

1457
01:17:45,739 --> 01:17:48,239
単体ならマイナスになんない？
If it's on its own, it won't be a loss?

1458
01:17:53,039 --> 01:17:54,939
え、難しいなぁー。
Man, this is tough...

1459
01:17:55,339 --> 01:17:57,439
なんか… ソピアがずっとなんか喋ってる…
Sopia's been muttering something non-stop...

1460
01:17:58,039 --> 01:17:59,639
え、一旦さぁ…
Wait, for now...

1461
01:18:00,539 --> 01:18:03,739
一旦ドパい馬さんも入れときたいから…
I also want to include a horse that gives a dopamine rush, so...

1462
01:18:04,239 --> 01:18:06,339
3号？3号…
No. 3? No. 3...

1463
01:18:06,639 --> 01:18:10,039
3号… こいつを… これぐらいで買っとくか。
No. 3... Let's buy this one for about this much.

1464
01:18:12,739 --> 01:18:14,339
一旦買っとくか。
Should I just buy it for now?

1465
01:18:15,239 --> 01:18:17,339
あ、でも8とかの方がいいか？
Ah, but maybe No. 8 is better?

1466
01:18:17,739 --> 01:18:19,839
8単はあってもいいかも。
A Win on 8 might be good.

1467
01:18:21,039 --> 01:18:23,439
ちょ、じゃあこいつをもうちょっと大きめにして…
Wait, then let's make this one a bit bigger...

1468
01:18:24,539 --> 01:18:26,339
こいつ大きめにして…
Make this one bigger...

1469
01:18:28,339 --> 01:18:29,339
ほんで…
And then...

1470
01:18:29,939 --> 01:18:31,039
ほんで…
And...

1471
01:18:32,839 --> 01:18:34,339
ほんで…
And...

1472
01:18:34,439 --> 01:18:36,739
これぐらい… これぐらい。
About this much... About this much.

1473
01:18:37,439 --> 01:18:38,739
これぐらい。
About this much.

1474
01:18:40,539 --> 01:18:42,139
これでええか？
Is this good?

1475
01:18:42,439 --> 01:18:45,139
あと何、あと何か買ってないか？
What else, is there anything else I haven't bought?

1476
01:18:48,239 --> 01:18:50,939
もっと買ってもいいと思うんじゃけど…
I feel like I could buy even more, though...

1477
01:18:51,439 --> 01:18:53,439
え、だってまだお金いっぱいあるよ？
Wait, 'cause I still have plenty of money!

1478
01:18:53,639 --> 01:18:55,039
まだお金いっぱいあるよ？
I still have lots of money left?

1479
01:18:55,839 --> 01:18:57,139
え、いっぱいあるよ！
I have tons left!

1480
01:18:57,739 --> 01:18:59,939
いっぱいあるからもっと買っていいんじゃない？
Since I have so much, shouldn't I buy more?

1481
01:19:00,039 --> 01:19:02,239
なんか思ってるより所持金多い、わし。
Somehow I have way more money than I thought.

1482
01:19:04,039 --> 01:19:05,539
17万あるよ！
I have 170,000!

1483
01:19:09,039 --> 01:19:10,439
ワイド買うか。
Guess I'll buy Quinplace.

1484
01:19:11,439 --> 01:19:13,639
もう一応買っちゃったけどな…
Though I already bought some just in case...

1485
01:19:17,739 --> 01:19:20,339
え、なんかちまちま賭けなくていいんじゃない？お金いっぱいあるよ？
Wait, don't I not need to bet in tiny amounts? I've got plenty of money!

1486
01:19:20,439 --> 01:19:23,439
ちょっと… なんかビビっちゃってさ、わし。ビビっちゃってさぁ…
It's just... I'm being a scaredy-cat. I'm getting cold feet...

1487
01:19:23,639 --> 01:19:25,839
なんかあんま買えないんだよね。
I just can't bring myself to buy a lot, you know?

1488
01:19:26,039 --> 01:19:28,939
ビビッちゃうのじゃ、わし。ちょっと弱いかも。
I get cold feet. I might be a bit weak-willed.

1489
01:19:29,939 --> 01:19:31,239
全額？！
All of it?!

1490
01:19:31,439 --> 01:19:32,839
これ全額？！
Is this all-in?!

1491
01:19:36,939 --> 01:19:38,339
もらえるっぽいよ。
Looks like we will.

1492
01:19:40,939 --> 01:19:43,139
え、ビビっちゃうんだよね、わし。
Yeah, I just get cold feet.

1493
01:19:45,139 --> 01:19:46,839
全額はまずい？
Is going all-in bad?

1494
01:19:48,239 --> 01:19:50,939
わし、わしがビビりすぎかも。
Maybe I'm being way too much of a scaredy-cat.

1495
01:19:51,439 --> 01:19:52,939
ビビりすぎかも。
Way too scared.

1496
01:19:57,839 --> 01:19:58,839
お？
Oh?

1497
01:20:01,040 --> 01:20:03,120
サイエンス的にどっちが勝つかの？
From a scientific point of view, which one will win?

1498
01:20:03,280 --> 01:20:06,380
馬券購入締め切りまで、残り1分となっております。
One minute remaining until ticket sales close.

1499
01:20:06,380 --> 01:20:07,460
これぐらい？
About this much?

1500
01:20:07,620 --> 01:20:08,680
これぐらい！
About this much!

1501
01:20:10,920 --> 01:20:12,680
のじゃー！
Done-ja!

1502
01:20:14,940 --> 01:20:18,700
なんかこんがらがってきた！なんかこんがらがってきた！こんがらがってきたよ、わし！
I'm getting all confused! I'm getting totally confused! My head is spinning!

1503
01:20:19,200 --> 01:20:21,460
何が起きてるのか分かんなくなってきた！
I have no idea what's happening anymore!

1504
01:20:22,480 --> 01:20:25,040
分かんなくなってきたけど、買ってみた！
I got confused, but I bought them anyway!

1505
01:20:25,600 --> 01:20:28,520
なんか競馬が分からなすぎて...
I just don't understand horse racing at all...

1506
01:20:30,580 --> 01:20:33,920
いい買い方が分かんないんだけど、当たってたらいいな。
I don't know the right way to bet, but I hope I win.

1507
01:20:34,820 --> 01:20:38,720
なんかさ、わしさ、ギャンブルが本当に苦手でさ。
You know, I'm really bad at gambling.

1508
01:20:39,180 --> 01:20:42,240
苦手っていうかさ、沼っちゃうタイプだからさ、
Or rather, I'm the type to get dragged in deep...

1509
01:20:42,820 --> 01:20:45,740
向いてなくてさ、たぶんギャンブル。
So I'm probably not cut out for gambling.

1510
01:20:45,980 --> 01:20:49,840
向いてないってのがさ、分かってるからさ、すごいビビっちゃうんだよな。
And since I know I'm not cut out for it, I get super scared.

1511
01:20:51,000 --> 01:20:54,980
臆病者なのかも、わし。なんかドパドパ普段言ってるけど、
Maybe I'm just a coward. I always talk about dopamine rushes, but...

1512
01:20:55,240 --> 01:20:58,060
言ってるだけで、本当にドパれるかと言われると...
I just say it. If you ask me if I can actually chase that high...

1513
01:20:58,300 --> 01:21:01,640
本当にドパを求めているのかと言うと、求めてないのかも。
Or if I'm even seeking dopamine in the first place, maybe I'm not.

1514
01:21:02,580 --> 01:21:05,860
実はわし、ドパなんて求めてないのかも。
Deep down, maybe I'm not looking for thrills at all.

1515
01:21:06,080 --> 01:21:09,020
心の安寧と平穏しか求めてないのかも、わし。
Maybe all I really want is peace of mind and tranquility.

1516
01:21:09,220 --> 01:21:11,000
ドパって必要なのか？
Do I even need dopamine?

1517
01:21:14,640 --> 01:21:17,740
なんかすごい迷ってきた。迷ってきた。
I'm having second thoughts. Big second thoughts.

1518
01:21:19,480 --> 01:21:22,000
なんか口だけ...口で言ってるだけ。
I was just all talk... completely all talk.

1519
01:21:23,000 --> 01:21:27,500
ゲームだからと言ってさ、ゲームだからと言ってさ、なんか食べてる、つづりが！
Just because it's a game... Just because it's a game, Tuduri is eating something!

1520
01:21:29,740 --> 01:21:31,040
くわえてる！
She's holding it in her mouth!

1521
01:21:32,360 --> 01:21:35,880
いろは先輩曰くね、くわえてるとね、当たるんだって！
According to Iroha-senpai, if you hold it in your mouth, you'll win!

1522
01:21:36,060 --> 01:21:37,740
それ本当か？
Is that really true?

1523
01:21:38,340 --> 01:21:39,700
え、それ本当か？
Wait, is that for real?

1524
01:21:40,880 --> 01:21:43,500
これで当てて証明してやる！
I'll win with this and prove it!

1525
01:21:45,960 --> 01:21:47,320
なんか食べてる。
She's eating something.

1526
01:21:47,500 --> 01:21:51,940
なんかね、どうしてもね、あの...怖いことを想像しちゃうんだよな。
You know, I can't help but imagine the worst-case scenarios.

1527
01:21:52,580 --> 01:21:55,640
わし、自分の運の良さを信じられてないかも。
Maybe I just don't believe in my own luck.

1528
01:21:58,060 --> 01:22:01,040
よし、何を応援するか確認しとこ。
All right, let me check who I should be cheering for.

1529
01:22:01,500 --> 01:22:03,340
何買ったんだっけ、わし？
What did I buy again?

1530
01:22:04,100 --> 01:22:09,500
えー、1、6、7、8。1、6、7、8ね。オッケー。
Uh, 1, 6, 7, 8. 1, 6, 7, and 8, right? Okay.

1531
01:22:09,780 --> 01:22:12,740
色を確認しよう。ええと...
Let's check the colors. Um...

1532
01:22:13,140 --> 01:22:15,440
白、緑、オレンジ、ピンク。
White, green, orange, pink.

1533
01:22:19,120 --> 01:22:22,980
白、緑、オレンジ、ピンクね。
White, green, orange, and pink.

1534
01:22:26,720 --> 01:22:28,720
これ忘れてた、消すの。
I forgot to close this menu.

1535
01:22:28,920 --> 01:22:31,780
失礼、失礼、失礼。
Excuse me, sorry, sorry.

1536
01:22:35,220 --> 01:22:37,480
白...白...
White... white...

1537
01:22:39,240 --> 01:22:41,360
緑、オレンジ、
Green, orange,

1538
01:22:43,460 --> 01:22:44,720
ピンク。
pink.

1539
01:22:47,980 --> 01:22:49,840
実況来たよー。
The commentary is here!

1540
01:22:52,600 --> 01:22:54,000
いけるかな？
Can I do it?

1541
01:22:55,640 --> 01:22:57,840
のじゃー！始まったー！
Noja-! It started!

1542
01:22:58,140 --> 01:23:01,140
行くのじゃ！白、オレンジ、緑、ピンク！
Let's go-ja! White, orange, green, pink!

1543
01:23:01,900 --> 01:23:05,240
ガンガン行け！頑張って！頑張って！
Push forward! Keep going! Keep going!

1544
01:23:08,120 --> 01:23:11,080
なんか全然ドパマンダーの賭け方じゃないよね。
This isn't how a Dopamander bets at all, huh?

1545
01:23:13,740 --> 01:23:17,840
なんか...何だ何だ？！何とかなれ！頑張れー！
Wait... what's happening?! Come on, hang in there! Go for it!

1546
01:23:20,420 --> 01:23:21,900
頑張ってー！
Keep it up!

1547
01:23:25,660 --> 01:23:27,500
はい、はい、はい。
Okay, okay, okay.

1548
01:23:27,700 --> 01:23:30,380
白、赤、はい、はい、はい。
White, red, okay, okay, okay.

1549
01:23:30,940 --> 01:23:34,400
段差ってこういうことか！段差があるからね。はい、はい、はい。
Oh, so that's what the steps mean! There are elevation drops. Right, right, right.

1550
01:23:36,840 --> 01:23:38,480
白、白か？
White, is that white?

1551
01:23:38,740 --> 01:23:40,340
白速いな！
White is fast!

1552
01:23:42,480 --> 01:23:44,300
お、白頑張ってるのじゃ！
Ooh, White is working hard-ja!

1553
01:23:47,460 --> 01:23:49,980
おや？なんか遅めだな？
Huh? They seem kinda slow?

1554
01:23:50,160 --> 01:23:52,000
1が頑張ってるな。
Number 1 is doing great.

1555
01:23:52,480 --> 01:23:54,600
なんか運動会の応援みたい。
It feels like cheering at a sports day.

1556
01:23:55,640 --> 01:23:58,060
追い上げてる！追い上げてる！8すごい！
It's catching up! It's catching up! Number 8 is amazing!

1557
01:23:59,440 --> 01:24:01,560
すごいな、8！
Number 8 is incredible!

1558
01:24:02,020 --> 01:24:03,900
混戦？すごい混戦！
A close fight? It's super close!

1559
01:24:04,740 --> 01:24:08,420
でも3000メートルだからね、3000メートル。まだまだあるからね。
Though it's a 3,000-meter race. 3,000 meters. There's still plenty left.

1560
01:24:10,080 --> 01:24:11,540
すごいな、8！
Number 8 is crazy!

1561
01:24:14,480 --> 01:24:17,780
混戦？圧倒的だな！こいつすごいな！
Close fight? It's overwhelming! This horse is crazy!

1562
01:24:18,480 --> 01:24:20,420
8すごいな！
Number 8 is unbelievable!

1563
01:24:22,040 --> 01:24:24,960
8すごかった！8すごい！
Number 8 was insane! 8 is incredible!

1564
01:24:25,480 --> 01:24:28,380
おおー！
Whoa-!

1565
01:24:28,400 --> 01:24:29,880
どうじゃ？どうじゃ？
How is it? How'd it go?

1566
01:24:30,540 --> 01:24:33,100
え、まだある？まだある？まだある？まだある？
Wait, is there more? Is there more? More? More?

1567
01:24:33,360 --> 01:24:34,980
まだある？
Is there still more?

1568
01:24:35,180 --> 01:24:38,240
いや、ないないないない！
No, no, no, no, no!

1569
01:24:38,440 --> 01:24:40,940
終わりだ！終わりだ！
That's the finish! It's over!

1570
01:24:44,040 --> 01:24:46,320
どうなった？何が当たった？
What happened? What won?

1571
01:24:46,940 --> 01:24:49,540
何が当たった？わし当たった？
What won? Did I win?

1572
01:24:49,940 --> 01:24:52,580
当たったかも分かんないよ。
I don't even know if I won.

1573
01:24:53,980 --> 01:24:57,420
何買った、わし？わし何買ったっけ？
What did I buy? What did I buy again?

1574
01:24:57,840 --> 01:24:59,500
単勝8買ったよ！
I bought a Win ticket on 8!

1575
01:24:59,700 --> 01:25:00,940
単勝...
Win...

1576
01:25:00,981 --> 01:25:02,131
もしかして...
Could it be...?

1577
01:25:02,781 --> 01:25:04,381
えっと、ワイド？
Um, a Quinplace?

1578
01:25:04,831 --> 01:25:06,381
1、8...
1, 8...

1579
01:25:06,581 --> 01:25:07,681
当たった？
Did I win?

1580
01:25:08,081 --> 01:25:11,581
わかんない。何が当たったかわかんないから入れてみてみよう、主ら。
I don't know. I don't know what hit, so let's put them in and see, everyone.

1581
01:25:13,081 --> 01:25:14,081
よいしょ。
All right.

1582
01:25:14,781 --> 01:25:16,781
よいしょ。これ...
All right. This one...

1583
01:25:17,981 --> 01:25:21,081
これ0円、これ外れだって。これ外れ。
This is 0 yen, so this is a miss. A miss.

1584
01:25:21,781 --> 01:25:24,381
これは？これも外れ。
How about this? Another miss.

1585
01:25:24,981 --> 01:25:28,181
これは？これは、これ当たり？
How about this? Is this... did this win?

1586
01:25:28,381 --> 01:25:30,781
これ単勝が当たったのか？
Did my Win bet hit?

1587
01:25:30,981 --> 01:25:33,381
んで？こっちの単勝は？
And then? How about this Win bet?

1588
01:25:33,781 --> 01:25:35,581
当たりじゃない。んで？
Not a winner. And then?

1589
01:25:35,981 --> 01:25:38,981
え？なんか、なんか当たったんじゃない、これ？
Huh? Wait, didn't something... didn't something hit here?

1590
01:25:39,381 --> 01:25:42,181
ワイドが当たった！ワイドが当たって...
A Quinplace hit! A Quinplace hit and...

1591
01:25:42,781 --> 01:25:45,981
このワイドも... あ、すごい！なんかいっぱい当たったかも！
This Quinplace too... Ah, amazing! I think a bunch of them hit!

1592
01:25:46,781 --> 01:25:49,281
いっぱい当たったんじゃない、主ら？
Didn't I win a whole lot, everyone?

1593
01:25:52,981 --> 01:25:54,881
58万円もらった！
I got 580,000 yen!

1594
01:25:54,981 --> 01:25:57,781
結構すごいんじゃない？ドパリーンなんじゃない？
Isn't that pretty incredible? Isn't that pure Dopamine rush?

1595
01:25:57,981 --> 01:26:00,981
ねえ、つづり、つづり聞いて！あ、つづり当たった？
Hey, Tuduri, Tuduri listen! Ah, Tuduri, did you win?

1596
01:26:00,281 --> 01:26:02,781
つづり、まだ、次のレースに賭けてっから！
Tuduri's still... I'm betting on the next race!

1597
01:26:02,881 --> 01:26:04,981
わし58万円当たったよ！
I won 580,000 yen!

1598
01:26:05,181 --> 01:26:06,481
君は？
How about you?

1599
01:26:06,781 --> 01:26:09,981
君は？これ... 君は、君は、君は？
How about you? This... What about you, you, you?

1600
01:26:10,781 --> 01:26:13,281
くわえてる。つづり当たった？
She's holding it in her mouth. Tuduri, did you win?

1601
01:26:14,781 --> 01:26:16,981
くわえてるつづり当たった？
Mouth-holding Tuduri, did you win?

1602
01:26:18,781 --> 01:26:21,381
くわえて当たった？どうじゃ、どうじゃ？
Did you hold it and win? How'd it go? How'd it go?

1603
01:26:21,381 --> 01:26:22,981
めっちゃ金減った...
My money shrank so much...

1604
01:26:22,981 --> 01:26:24,981
えっへへへへ！
Hehehehe!

1605
01:26:25,981 --> 01:26:28,481
のじゃー！え、めっちゃ凄いんじゃない？
Noja~! Wow, aren't I super amazing?

1606
01:26:28,681 --> 01:26:30,781
34万円勝ちました！
I won 340,000 yen!

1607
01:26:30,981 --> 01:26:32,981
えっ、34万？！
Wait, 340,000?!

1608
01:26:33,081 --> 01:26:35,381
そぴあ、そぴあマウント取りに来た！
Sopia, Sopia came to flex on us!

1609
01:26:35,981 --> 01:26:38,281
えっ、58万円当たった！
Wait, I won 580,000 yen!

1610
01:26:39,981 --> 01:26:43,981
やっぱご利益単勝... あ、やっぱ強いよ。え、でもそぴあも34万返ってきたよ？
As expected of the Blessing Win bet... Yeah, it's strong! Wait, but Sopia got 340,000 back too?

1611
01:26:43,981 --> 01:26:45,981
うん、わし58万返ってきた！
Yep, I got 580,000 back!

1612
01:26:49,781 --> 01:26:53,781
アーニャ先輩！アーニャ先輩！アーニャ先輩のためにあの... 焼き鳥買ってきました！
Anya-senpai! Anya-senpai! Um... I bought some yakitori for you!

1613
01:26:53,981 --> 01:26:56,481
えっ？あ... ありがとう。
Huh? Ah... Thank you.

1614
01:26:56,481 --> 01:26:57,981
アーニャ先輩！
Anya-senpai!

1615
01:26:57,781 --> 01:27:00,481
それ... それメラっちが... メラっちが買ったやつ...
That... That's the one Melacchi... Melacchi bought...

1616
01:27:00,581 --> 01:27:01,781
のじゃ！
Noja!

1617
01:27:01,981 --> 01:27:03,281
えっ、本当だ！
Wait, you're right!

1618
01:27:03,781 --> 01:27:06,981
えっ、ちょっ... わっ、どうやって落とすの？どうやって落とすの？
Wait, a sec... Wh- How do you drop it? How do you drop it?

1619
01:27:06,981 --> 01:27:08,481
Q、Q、Q！Q、Q！
Q, Q, Q! Q, Q!

1620
01:27:09,481 --> 01:27:12,481
のじゃ！
Noja!

1621
01:27:10,481 --> 01:27:12,481
Hiya Anya~!

1622
01:27:12,781 --> 01:27:15,481
Why you that to your kohai?!
Why you do that to your kohai?!

1623
01:27:15,581 --> 01:27:16,481
What?!

1624
01:27:17,781 --> 01:27:20,481
Why you're like beat your kohai?!

1625
01:27:21,481 --> 01:27:23,481
Because I'm sad!

1626
01:27:23,981 --> 01:27:24,981
Why sad?

1627
01:27:24,981 --> 01:27:26,781
アーニャさん負けた？
Did Anya-san lose?

1628
01:27:25,781 --> 01:27:26,981
I'm sad!

1629
01:27:27,481 --> 01:27:28,981
Then lost! You, then lost!

1630
01:27:28,781 --> 01:27:30,181
全部すった！
I lost everything!

1631
01:27:30,181 --> 01:27:31,381
のじゃ！
Noja!

1632
01:27:30,981 --> 01:27:32,481
うるせー！
Shut up!

1633
01:27:32,281 --> 01:27:34,981
全部すったのじゃー！
You lost everything, noja~!

1634
01:27:34,181 --> 01:27:36,781
全部すった！全額競馬で全部すった！
Lost everything! Lost all my money on horse racing!

1635
01:27:36,781 --> 01:27:40,181
やっぱご利益単勝... 全勝ち！ド勝ちのご利益単勝！
As expected of the Blessing Win bet... Total victory! Mega win with the Blessing Win bet!

1636
01:27:40,181 --> 01:27:41,781
えっ、メラっち当たったの？
Wait, Melacchi, you won?

1637
01:27:41,781 --> 01:27:43,981
わしね、58万当たりました！
I won 580,000 yen!

1638
01:27:45,981 --> 01:27:47,481
のじゃー！
Noja~!

1639
01:27:47,981 --> 01:27:49,781
そぴあ34万勝ちました！
Sopia won 340,000 yen!

1640
01:27:49,781 --> 01:27:51,981
自分のこと信じない、もう...
I'm never trusting myself again...

1641
01:27:54,981 --> 01:27:56,481
のじゃー！
Noja~!

1642
01:27:56,981 --> 01:27:58,981
えっ、ほら、勝ちましたよ、34万！
Hey look, I won! 340,000!

1643
01:27:59,981 --> 01:28:02,981
えー、まぁ詐欺ではないか、勝ったなら。
Well, I guess it's not a scam if you won.

1644
01:28:03,481 --> 01:28:05,481
でもわしより低いよ！
But that's lower than mine!

1645
01:28:05,481 --> 01:28:06,981
相変わらずサイエンス...
As always, Science...

1646
01:28:06,981 --> 01:28:09,481
ご利益... サイエンスより運や！
Blessing... Luck beats science!

1647
01:28:10,481 --> 01:28:13,481
いや、でも、ね、そこを2人で組めばもっと強いんじゃ...
No, but hey, if the two of us team up, wouldn't we be even stronger...?

1648
01:28:13,481 --> 01:28:15,981
確かに確かに！対立するものじゃない！確かに確かに！
True, true! It's not something to oppose each other over! True, true!

1649
01:28:16,481 --> 01:28:19,481
お金がないのに、私は焼き鳥とビールを買い続けている...
Even though I have no money, I just keep on buying yakitori and beer...

1650
01:28:19,481 --> 01:28:21,481
キョーコどうだったの？
How did it go, Kyoko?

1651
01:28:21,481 --> 01:28:22,981
負けた？
Did you lose?

1652
01:28:21,981 --> 01:28:23,481
え、さっきね、あ、全溶かし！
Well earlier, ah, total meltdown!

1653
01:28:23,181 --> 01:28:24,981
だぁーはははは！
Daaa-hahahaha!

1654
01:28:24,981 --> 01:28:26,481
全溶かししたよ！
I lost every single penny!

1655
01:28:26,481 --> 01:28:29,781
なんか競馬場にいる本当にダメな人みたいな言い方やめてね！
Stop talking like you're an actual hopeless degenerate at the racetrack!

1656
01:28:30,981 --> 01:28:32,981
ああ、全溶かしだよ、もうこれやぁ...
Ah, total meltdown, geez, this is...

1657
01:28:32,981 --> 01:28:34,181
奢ってあげようか、なんか。
Should I buy you something?

1658
01:28:34,181 --> 01:28:36,981
あ、飲んでなきゃやってらんねえよ、これもう、これ！
Ah, I can't do this without drinking, honestly!

1659
01:28:37,981 --> 01:28:39,981
ドカ呑みなのじゃ！
Binge drinking, noja!

1660
01:28:39,981 --> 01:28:41,981
あ、飲んでなきゃやってらんねえよ、これもう！
Ah, I can't do this without drinking, honestly!

1661
01:28:42,181 --> 01:28:43,981
へっへっへっへ！
Hehehehe!

1662
01:28:44,281 --> 01:28:47,481
大穴狙いで58万勝ち！
Aiming for longshots and winning 580,000!

1663
01:28:47,181 --> 01:28:48,781
サイエンスで34万勝ち！
Winning 340,000 with Science!

1664
01:28:48,781 --> 01:28:50,181
のじゃー！
Noja~!

1665
01:28:50,981 --> 01:28:52,481
え、じゃあマジで奢って？
Wait, seriously treat me then?

1666
01:28:52,481 --> 01:28:54,181
いいよ！何ほしい？
Sure! What do you want?

1667
01:28:54,981 --> 01:28:58,981
うんとね、うんとね、うんとね... うん、じゃあそこの、そこに置いてある木ほしい！
Well, let's see, let's see, let's see... Yeah, then I want the tree sitting over there!

1668
01:28:58,981 --> 01:29:00,481
木？！これ取っ... これ買って...
Tree?! Take this... buy this...

1669
01:29:00,981 --> 01:29:03,981
うん、これお家に飾りたいから、ここの観葉植物買って！
Yeah, I want to decorate my house with it, so buy the houseplant here!

1670
01:29:03,981 --> 01:29:06,781
え、これなんか器物破損とかにならない？
Wait, wouldn't that count as property damage or something?

1671
01:29:07,981 --> 01:29:10,481
あ、これ木部... え、これ売り物じゃないの、これ？ダメなの？
Ah, this wood... Huh, is this not for sale? It's not allowed?

1672
01:29:10,481 --> 01:29:11,981
これダメそうじゃん。
That looks like a no-go.

1673
01:29:11,981 --> 01:29:14,481
え、ちょっと待って。売店行ってくるからちょっと待っててね！
Wait a second. I'm gonna hit the concession stand, so wait for me, okay?

1674
01:29:14,481 --> 01:29:15,981
耳とかつければ？
Why not wear horse ears or something?

1675
01:29:15,981 --> 01:29:18,981
え、耳ももうつけらんないの！今口にくわえてるから！
Eh, I can't wear ears anymore! Because I'm holding something in my mouth right now!

1676
01:29:18,981 --> 01:29:20,781
あ、口くわえてたらダメなのか。
Ah, holding it in your mouth means you can't.

1677
01:29:20,981 --> 01:29:23,781
うん、そうそうそう。え、これ何？これ、これ欲しいかもしんない、じゃあ！
Yeah, exactly. Huh, what's this? I might want this then!

1678
01:29:23,781 --> 01:29:25,481
これ多分売り物じゃないのじゃ！
That's probably not for sale, noja!

1679
01:29:25,781 --> 01:29:26,981
これ売り物じゃないか...
So it's not for sale...

1680
01:29:26,981 --> 01:29:28,481
これ飾りなのじゃ！
It's just decoration, noja!

1681
01:29:28,981 --> 01:29:30,981
なんか一番高いやつないかな？
Isn't there something super expensive?

1682
01:29:30,981 --> 01:29:32,981
キョーコ酔いすぎなのじゃ、お主！
Kyoko, you're way too drunk!

1683
01:29:32,981 --> 01:29:35,481
待って、これジュース... あの、ジュース、ジュース！ソフトドリンク！
Wait, this juice... um, juice, juice! A soft drink!

1684
01:29:36,981 --> 01:29:39,481
いらないよ、そんなの！いらないよ！
I don't need that! I don't want it!

1685
01:29:39,481 --> 01:29:42,981
やばい、酔っ払いにエナドリ... エナドリじゃない、ソフトドリダメだって！
Oh man, an energy drink for a drunk... not energy drink, soft drink is no good!

1686
01:29:42,981 --> 01:29:45,481
ま、しゃあない、ビールに混ぜて飲むわ、これじゃあ！
Well whatever, I'll mix it with beer and drink it then!

1687
01:29:45,481 --> 01:29:46,981
おごった！
I treated you!

1688
01:29:47,981 --> 01:29:49,981
シャンディガフ風にするわ、じゃあ！
I'll make it like a shandy then!

1689
01:29:49,981 --> 01:29:52,981
警察そんな酔っ払っててできるのお仕事？
Can a police officer really do her job when she's that drunk?

1690
01:29:53,481 --> 01:29:54,981
あ、今日オフだよ！
Ah, I'm off duty today!

1691
01:29:54,981 --> 01:29:57,981
あ、オフだから来てんのか！制服で来ていいのか競馬場！
Ah, so that's why you're here! Is it okay to come to the racetrack in uniform?!

1692
01:29:57,981 --> 01:30:00,481
あ、今日スバル先輩がいるから大丈夫！
Ah, Subaru-senpai is here today, so it's fine!

1693
01:30:01,402 --> 01:30:02,302
え？
Huh?

1694
01:30:02,602 --> 01:30:03,802
何？
What?

1695
01:30:03,802 --> 01:30:04,902
何？
What is it?

1696
01:30:05,102 --> 01:30:06,502
つーちゃんは凄かったんだもんね？
Tsu-chan was amazing, wasn't she?

1697
01:30:06,502 --> 01:30:07,902
つーちゃんは凄かったよね
Tsu-chan really was amazing.

1698
01:30:07,902 --> 01:30:10,102
つーちゃんは夢を買ったんだから！
Because Tsu-chan bought a dream!

1699
01:30:10,102 --> 01:30:11,202
凄かったよ
You were amazing!

1700
01:30:10,602 --> 01:30:12,402
ダメな人のセリフやん
That's what a loser says!

1701
01:30:12,402 --> 01:30:14,202
暖色組、負けてるー！
The warm color team is losing!

1702
01:30:14,202 --> 01:30:16,102
おや、暖色組さん？
Oh, the warm color team?

1703
01:30:16,202 --> 01:30:18,002
おやおや。のじゃのじゃ
My, oh my. Noja, noja.

1704
01:30:18,602 --> 01:30:21,102
でもウチらの方が夢見せてるから！
But we're giving people bigger dreams!

1705
01:30:21,102 --> 01:30:22,202
え、そうだよ
Yeah, exactly.

1706
01:30:22,002 --> 01:30:24,202
え、勝たないと夢は見せれねえのじゃ！
Eh, you can't show them dreams unless you win, noja!

1707
01:30:24,202 --> 01:30:26,002
自分勝ててないの？勝って...
You didn't win yourself? Winning...

1708
01:30:26,002 --> 01:30:28,402
あ、あっち、あっちだ。まだ新聞買いに行かなきゃ
Ah, over there, that way. I still need to go buy a newspaper.

1709
01:30:28,402 --> 01:30:29,902
あ、次の新聞買いたい
Ah, I want to buy the next newspaper.

1710
01:30:29,902 --> 01:30:33,402
新聞、新聞！新聞、新聞、新聞！新聞、新聞、新聞！
Newspaper, newspaper! Newspaper, newspaper, newspaper! Newspaper, newspaper, newspaper!

1711
01:30:32,402 --> 01:30:34,402
どこだ？どこだ？新聞ここか？
Where is it? Where is it? Is the newspaper here?

1712
01:30:34,002 --> 01:30:38,502
0円なんてね、ね？全財産溶かした人にはしんどいと思うけど...
0 yen is, you know... I'm sure it's rough on whoever melted their whole fortune, but...

1713
01:30:38,702 --> 01:30:41,002
確かに。買ってあげる？かわいそうだから
Totally. Want me to buy one for them? Out of pity.

1714
01:30:40,802 --> 01:30:43,102
さっきから怪しい人がいてー
There's been a suspicious person around for a while...

1715
01:30:42,802 --> 01:30:44,702
なんだよ、染めて決まるのかよ...
What the heck, is it decided by dyes?...

1716
01:30:44,202 --> 01:30:46,002
のじゃーー！
Nojaaa!

1717
01:30:46,002 --> 01:30:47,402
パーセントがどんどん...
The percentages keep...

1718
01:30:47,402 --> 01:30:48,302
よいしょ
Up we go.

1719
01:30:48,202 --> 01:30:49,802
やってやりますわ
Let's do this!

1720
01:30:49,502 --> 01:30:50,802
買えた！
Bought it!

1721
01:30:50,802 --> 01:30:52,202
プロの予想屋さんですから
Because she's a pro prediction expert.

1722
01:30:51,802 --> 01:30:54,302
34万勝ったという実績がある
I've got a proven track record of winning 340,000 yen!

1723
01:30:54,302 --> 01:30:56,202
えー、すごい！
Whoa, amazing!

1724
01:30:56,202 --> 01:30:59,202
パドック楽しみ。でもミニゲーム始まるっておぬしら！
Looking forward to the paddock. But guys, the mini-game is starting!

1725
01:30:59,202 --> 01:31:01,602
おぬしら、ミニゲームだって！
Guys, they said there's a mini-game!

1726
01:31:01,602 --> 01:31:04,002
ミニゲームでもお金稼げるらしいよ！
Apparently you can earn money in the mini-game too!

1727
01:31:03,802 --> 01:31:06,402
あ、居ますね、居ますね、居ますね、居ますね！
Ah, there she is, there she is, there she is, there she is!

1728
01:31:05,902 --> 01:31:07,802
階段越しにいたほうがいいんじゃない？
Wouldn't it be better to stay behind the stairs?

1729
01:31:07,202 --> 01:31:08,702
のじゃーー！
Nojaaa!

1730
01:31:08,802 --> 01:31:11,502
ミニゲームどこに行ったらやれるんだ？
Where do I go to play the mini-game?

1731
01:31:11,502 --> 01:31:13,602
まだ始まってない
It hasn't started yet.

1732
01:31:13,602 --> 01:31:15,302
この方！
This one!

1733
01:31:17,802 --> 01:31:19,402
ちょ、キョーコ！
Wait, Kyoko!

1734
01:31:19,402 --> 01:31:22,002
キョーコが捕まえてくれるらしい！
Sounds like Kyoko will catch them!

1735
01:31:22,002 --> 01:31:24,002
マジで草
That's hilarious.

1736
01:31:24,002 --> 01:31:25,402
のじゃーー！
Nojaaa!

1737
01:31:25,402 --> 01:31:27,302
全員ぶち殺してやる
I'll beat the crap out of all of them.

1738
01:31:27,302 --> 01:31:29,002
ほな全員ぶち殺してやる？
So you're gonna beat the crap out of everyone?

1739
01:31:29,002 --> 01:31:30,802
全員ぶち殺してやる
Beat the crap out of all of them.

1740
01:31:30,402 --> 01:31:31,802
ミニゲームで？
In the mini-game?

1741
01:31:31,802 --> 01:31:32,902
ミニゲームで？！
In the mini-game?!

1742
01:31:31,802 --> 01:31:34,202
治安悪っ
So rowdy!

1743
01:31:32,802 --> 01:31:34,402
殺し合い？！
A fight to the death?!

1744
01:31:34,402 --> 01:31:36,302
さっき全部負けたからさー
I lost everything just now, you see...

1745
01:31:36,002 --> 01:31:37,602
全部負けたんすか？！
You lost everything?!

1746
01:31:37,402 --> 01:31:40,802
うん、全部負けたもん。失うものねえんだもん。失うものねえんだー
Yeah, lost everything. 'Cause I got nothing left to lose. Nothing left to lose!

1747
01:31:39,202 --> 01:31:40,602
のじゃ！
Noja!

1748
01:31:41,402 --> 01:31:46,302
ぼたん先輩、結構最初ドヤッてしてたから、なんかめっちゃ強い系かと思ったら...
Botan-senpai was acting pretty smug at first, so I thought she was super good at this, but...

1749
01:31:46,302 --> 01:31:49,302
やっぱ競馬って、なんか必勝法ない感じか
Looks like there really isn't any sure-fire way to win in horse racing.

1750
01:31:49,302 --> 01:31:53,402
どんなに当てられる人でも外すことはある感じか。だったら...
Even someone who makes great predictions misses sometimes. In that case...

1751
01:31:53,402 --> 01:31:57,202
だったら、そぴあのサイエンスメソッド嘘じゃね？必勝法って言ってたぞ？
Then isn't Sopia's Science Method a lie? She said it was a sure-fire strategy!

1752
01:31:57,002 --> 01:32:01,602
0円だったしよー、後輩にもよしよしされたしよー
I ended up with 0 yen, and even my juniors were consoling me...

1753
01:32:02,402 --> 01:32:05,002
こわるいなー
How embarrassing...

1754
01:32:05,602 --> 01:32:08,402
なんかさっき大負けしてる人が多いなー
Seems like a lot of people took huge losses just now...

1755
01:32:08,402 --> 01:32:09,702
怖い
Scary.

1756
01:32:08,802 --> 01:32:10,502
優越なのじゃ！
I feel so superior, noja!

1757
01:32:10,502 --> 01:32:12,202
のじゃーー！
Nojaaa!

1758
01:32:12,402 --> 01:32:14,302
え、何が起きるか分からない
You never know what's going to happen.

1759
01:32:13,702 --> 01:32:15,302
のじゃーー！
Nojaaa!

1760
01:32:15,302 --> 01:32:17,302
そうかも。わしなかなかいいんじゃない？
That might be true. Aren't I doing pretty well?

1761
01:32:16,502 --> 01:32:18,002
なんか言ってるな！
Listen to her talk!

1762
01:32:18,002 --> 01:32:19,002
のじゃ！
Noja!

1763
01:32:18,302 --> 01:32:20,002
どうだ？なかなか...
How's it going? Doing pretty...

1764
01:32:20,002 --> 01:32:21,102
勝ってるんだ？
You winning?

1765
01:32:20,802 --> 01:32:23,002
めっちゃ勝ちましたのじゃ！
I won a ton, noja!

1766
01:32:23,702 --> 01:32:25,702
58万勝ちましたのじゃ！
I won 580,000 yen, noja!

1767
01:32:25,702 --> 01:32:28,402
次の予想、何じゃろうな
I wonder what the next prediction will be...

1768
01:32:28,402 --> 01:32:30,302
次の予想お願いします
Please give us your next prediction.

1769
01:32:30,302 --> 01:32:31,802
パドック次第...
Depends on the paddock...

1770
01:32:31,602 --> 01:32:33,402
パドック次第なのじゃ！
It depends on the paddock, noja!

1771
01:32:32,902 --> 01:32:34,402
パドック次第。確かに
Depends on the paddock. True.

1772
01:32:34,002 --> 01:32:35,502
後で聞こう
Let's ask later.

1773
01:32:35,002 --> 01:32:36,802
任せてくださいなのじゃ！
Leave it to me, noja!

1774
01:32:36,802 --> 01:32:38,702
今のところ毎回勝ってます！
I've won every time so far!

1775
01:32:38,602 --> 01:32:40,602
おー、すげえ！
Whoa, amazing!

1776
01:32:39,902 --> 01:32:41,202
のじゃ！
Noja!

1777
01:32:41,202 --> 01:32:43,502
え、治安悪っ！
Wait, so rowdy!

1778
01:32:42,802 --> 01:32:44,302
やっぱり天才
