1946
01:40:27,744 --> 01:40:31,244
いや、堅実に賭けましょうよ、じゃあまず。まずは堅実に…
No, let's bet sensibly first. Let's start sensibly...

1947
01:40:31,444 --> 01:40:34,744
でも、でもやっぱ賭けるのは欲しいもん！
But still, when I bet, I want a big payout!

1948
01:40:34,744 --> 01:40:37,544
いっぱい賭けしたらいっぱい返ってくるね。
If you bet a lot, you get a lot back.

1949
01:40:37,744 --> 01:40:40,844
減るほうが嫌なのじゃ。
I hate losing money more, noja.

1950
01:40:42,044 --> 01:40:44,644
今回、めらは… あ、居たね。
This time, Mela... Ah, there she is.

1951
01:40:49,044 --> 01:40:51,144
学ばなきゃ、後輩に。
I've got to learn from my junior.

1952
01:40:53,544 --> 01:40:58,144
え、ちょっとさ、人間ドーパミンを手に入れようと必死でヤバくないか？
Hey, aren't humans seriously crazy, getting so desperate to get that dopamine?

1953
01:40:58,344 --> 01:41:01,844
やっぱ、堅実さじゃないか？競馬に必要なのって。
Isn't sensibility what you really need in horse racing?

1954
01:41:02,344 --> 01:41:04,444
今60万持ってる！
I've got 600,000 right now!

1955
01:41:04,544 --> 01:41:05,744
やば！すご！
No way! Amazing!

1956
01:41:05,844 --> 01:41:08,144
マウント取っちゃおう！
Time to flex on them!

1957
01:41:10,544 --> 01:41:14,544
ずの先輩、マウント取っていいですか？
Zuno-senpai, can I flex on you?

1958
01:41:15,244 --> 01:41:18,044
あれ？のじゃ…のじゃマウント取っていいか？
Huh? Can noja... Can noja flex too?

1959
01:41:18,144 --> 01:41:20,444
今78万持ってますわし。
I'm holding 780,000 right now, washi.

1960
01:41:20,344 --> 01:41:22,844
くっやしーーー！
So frustrating!

1961
01:41:22,844 --> 01:41:24,544
めらエグイ！
Mela is crazy!

1962
01:41:24,544 --> 01:41:27,544
金返してくれえええ！
Give me back my moneyyy!

1963
01:41:27,544 --> 01:41:30,544
後輩に…
Begging a junior...

1964
01:41:33,844 --> 01:41:36,844
先輩に…先輩ええ顔ができるのじゃ。
I can act all proud in front of my senpai, noja.

1965
01:41:36,844 --> 01:41:39,244
ご利益担当ですのじゃ。
That's our divine blessing role, noja.

1966
01:41:39,844 --> 01:41:43,544
1レース目はそうでもなかったのに2レース目で来たの？
You didn't do much in Race 1, but hit it big in Race 2?

1967
01:41:43,544 --> 01:41:47,044
2レース目で58万くらい当てました。
In Race 2, I won around 580,000.

1968
01:41:47,044 --> 01:41:50,844
すごいじゃん！そこで10万負けたわ、勝ち額で。
That's amazing! I lost 100,000 of my winnings there.

1969
01:41:51,044 --> 01:41:53,244
ああー…10万。
Aah... 100,000.

1970
01:41:53,244 --> 01:41:54,644
パドック見ようパドック。
Let's check the paddock, paddock.

1971
01:41:54,644 --> 01:41:55,844
パドック見ます！
Checking the paddock!

1972
01:41:55,844 --> 01:41:58,244
のじゃー！始まる始まるー！
Nojaa! It's starting, it's starting!

1973
01:41:58,244 --> 01:42:02,344
え、なんかマウント取れて神や。めっちゃマウント取れて神や。
Whoa, flexing feels awesome. Being able to flex like that is god-tier.

1974
01:42:02,344 --> 01:42:08,444
ご利益担当…ご利益担当、マウント取れまくりなのじゃ。
Divine blessing rep... The divine blessing rep gets to flex all over everyone, noja.

1975
01:42:09,044 --> 01:42:12,244
パドックキラキラチェックでいいんじゃねえかなっていう…
Maybe we should just do the paddock sparkle check...

1976
01:42:12,244 --> 01:42:14,244
キラキラ見るか？
Should I check the sparkles?

1977
01:42:14,544 --> 01:42:19,044
うーん…なんか正直、勝つこと、お金をもらうこととかはよくて。
Hmm... Honestly, winning and getting money is fine and all,

1978
01:42:19,044 --> 01:42:21,644
お金は別に、あってもなくてもいいんだけど、
I don't really care whether I have money or not, but...

1979
01:42:21,644 --> 01:42:27,544
それよりも、あの、人間たちに勝っているという事実にドパれますのじゃ。
more than that, the fact that I'm beating all these humans gives me such a dopamine rush, noja.

1980
01:42:27,544 --> 01:42:31,844
わし性格悪いかも。わし…わし人の心なくなっちゃったかも。
I might be a terrible person. I... I might have lost my humanity.

1981
01:42:32,044 --> 01:42:35,544
[Title: 第3レース パドック]
[Title: Race 3 Paddock]

1982
01:42:33,044 --> 01:42:36,844
わし、競馬で狂っちゃったかも。本性が…
Horse racing might have driven me crazy. My true nature...

1983
01:42:37,544 --> 01:42:39,244
新聞見るか。
Let's look at the paper.

1984
01:42:39,544 --> 01:42:41,444
さあ、カイザーボルト…
Now, Kaiser Bolt...

1985
01:42:41,444 --> 01:42:45,344
一旦…でも1200か。1200じゃから、あ、怒ってる。
For now... wait, it's 1200m? Since it's 1200... Ah, it's angry.

1986
01:42:45,344 --> 01:42:49,344
怒り目、若干怒り目…若干怒り目…
Angry eyes, slightly angry eyes... slightly angry eyes...

1987
01:42:49,544 --> 01:42:51,844
1番ね。
Number 1, right.

1988
01:42:51,844 --> 01:42:54,044
続いてマガンホークアイ…
Next, Magan Hawkeye...

1989
01:42:54,544 --> 01:42:56,844
まあ普通、まあまあだな。
Well, normal, pretty average.

1990
01:42:56,844 --> 01:42:59,344
2番は普通。
Number 2 is normal.

1991
01:42:59,344 --> 01:43:01,344
2番普通。
Number 2 normal.

1992
01:43:01,344 --> 01:43:04,244
3番。え、普通かな？
Number 3. Eh, normal?

1993
01:43:04,244 --> 01:43:07,044
普通だな、今日のやる気。
It's normal today, its motivation.

1994
01:43:06,544 --> 01:43:08,544
3番普通。
Number 3 normal.

1995
01:43:08,544 --> 01:43:10,844
さあ、ジャイアントキル…
Now, Giant Kill...

1996
01:43:10,844 --> 01:43:14,244
3もなんもない、4もなんもない。
3 has nothing, 4 has nothing either.

1997
01:43:14,244 --> 01:43:16,544
前走2着でしたからね。
It was 2nd in the previous race, after all.

1998
01:43:16,544 --> 01:43:18,044
あ、キラキラ！
Ah, sparkles!

1999
01:43:18,044 --> 01:43:21,544
5が微妙で、6が結構あれか…
5 is iffy, and 6 is pretty...

2000
01:43:22,044 --> 01:43:25,044
6番？
Number 6?

2001
01:43:25,044 --> 01:43:27,544
6…
6...

2002
01:43:27,544 --> 01:43:29,544
やっぱ6なのかな…
Maybe it's 6...

2003
01:43:30,844 --> 01:43:33,044
6じゃの、6。
It's 6, noja, 6.

2004
01:43:33,544 --> 01:43:36,544
あ、7もキラキラなんじゃない？
Ah, isn't 7 sparkling too?

2005
01:43:36,544 --> 01:43:39,244
6、7…
6, 7...

2006
01:43:39,244 --> 01:43:42,244
8、8がなかなか…
8, 8 is quite...

2007
01:43:42,244 --> 01:43:44,244
めっちゃ怒ってる。
It's super angry.

2008
01:43:44,244 --> 01:43:46,044
怒り目…
Angry eyes...

2009
01:43:46,244 --> 01:43:49,044
8怒り目じゃの。
8 has angry eyes, noja.

2010
01:43:49,044 --> 01:43:52,044
ピンチだから怒ってんだわ。
It's angry because it's in a pinch.

2011
01:43:51,844 --> 01:43:53,044
うん。
Yeah.

2012
01:43:54,844 --> 01:43:57,544
まあ、6、7…
Well, 6, 7...

2013
01:43:57,544 --> 01:43:59,544
6、7か？
6 or 7?

2014
01:44:00,044 --> 01:44:04,244
でもスピードある個体がほしいな、今回1200。
But I want one with high speed, since it's 1200m this time.

2015
01:44:04,244 --> 01:44:10,544
1番…1番が結構怒り目だから、どう…どうかなー？
Number 1... Number 1 has pretty angry eyes, so how... how will it do?

2016
01:44:10,544 --> 01:44:12,244
どうかなー？
How will it do?

2017
01:44:12,244 --> 01:44:14,244
6…
6...

2018
01:44:14,244 --> 01:44:17,544
ま、2も普通なんだよな。普通ならまあいい、むしろ。
Well, 2 is normal too. If it's normal, that's fine, even.

2019
01:44:17,544 --> 01:44:21,544
減ってないならいいか。2、前走3位。
If it hasn't dropped, it's okay. 2 was 3rd in the previous race.

2020
01:44:21,544 --> 01:44:24,844
でもこのスピードで前走3位か…
But 3rd place in the previous race with this speed...?

2021
01:44:28,544 --> 01:44:31,044
ムズいな。
Tough.

2022
01:44:31,044 --> 01:44:34,544
6、7…
6, 7...

2023
01:44:39,544 --> 01:44:42,244
2普通じゃったっけ？2普通だったか。
Was 2 normal? 2 was normal, huh.

2024
01:44:44,044 --> 01:44:46,044
2普通だったら…
If 2 was normal...

2025
01:44:46,844 --> 01:44:51,044
2普通だったら2も全然ありだなと思っていて、
If 2 was normal, I think 2 is totally an option,

2026
01:44:51,544 --> 01:44:54,844
ね、スピード結構重要そうだよね。
hey, speed seems pretty important, right?

2027
01:44:55,844 --> 01:44:57,844
2普通だったから、おや…
Since 2 was normal, oh...

2028
01:44:58,844 --> 01:45:01,044
おや、トワ先輩。
Oh, Towa-senpai.

2029
01:45:02,115 --> 01:45:03,915
2レースどうだったから何？
What do you mean, "how was race 2"?

2030
01:45:05,915 --> 01:45:11,265
いや、6、7に行くかあ？
Man, should I go with 6 and 7...?

2031
01:45:06,565 --> 01:45:09,565
[Text: 現在の天気：晴]
[Text: Current Weather: Sunny]

2032
01:45:09,665 --> 01:45:12,565
[Text: 現在の馬場状態：良]
[Text: Current Track Condition: Good]

2033
01:45:12,565 --> 01:45:18,565
[Title: 予想家コーナー]
[Title: Tipster Corner]

2034
01:45:13,665 --> 01:45:18,865
なんか、トワ、トワ先輩、ど、どうですか？順調すか？
Like, Towa... Towa-senpai, how... how's it going? Going well?

2035
01:45:20,865 --> 01:45:22,565
あっ邪魔、止まるなよ！
Ah, you're in the way, don't just stand there!

2036
01:45:25,865 --> 01:45:29,965
なんかキレられた。予想家のコーナー始まった。予想家のコーナー始まったのじゃ。
She totally snapped at me... The tipster corner started. The tipster corner has started!

2037
01:45:31,865 --> 01:45:33,865
距離足りない！
It doesn't have enough stamina!

2038
01:45:34,865 --> 01:45:37,265
4-6が強い。
4 and 6 are strong.

2039
01:45:37,565 --> 01:45:38,865
4は何？
What is 4?

2040
01:45:38,665 --> 01:45:41,265
所持金どれくらいあるんすか今？
How much money do you have on you right now?

2041
01:45:41,865 --> 01:45:43,365
見張ってるの可愛い。
It's so cute how they're keeping watch.

2042
01:45:43,465 --> 01:45:45,265
さあ、予想屋...
Now then, the tipster...

2043
01:45:44,665 --> 01:45:47,865
今勝ってるんですか？1レース目、2レース目。
Are you winning right now? Across race 1 and race 2.

2044
01:45:48,065 --> 01:45:49,565
確かに、予想家さん。
Good point, Mr. Tipster.

2045
01:45:49,565 --> 01:45:52,565
予想家は今、1万だけ勝ってますね。
Right now, our tipster is up by just 10,000 yen.

2046
01:45:52,565 --> 01:45:54,065
ええ？おっと？
What? Uh-oh?

2047
01:45:54,065 --> 01:45:56,265
おっと？今おっと？信じられない！
Uh-oh? Did you just say "uh-oh"? Unbelievable!

2048
01:45:56,465 --> 01:46:01,265
ミニゲーム以下なんですけど...ミニゲーム以下なんですけど大丈夫ですか？
That's less than the mini-game... That's less than the mini-game, is that really okay?

2049
01:46:03,565 --> 01:46:06,565
ミニゲームのほうが稼いでんじゃないかよ。
Wait, didn't you make more from the mini-game?!

2050
01:46:05,565 --> 01:46:07,565
確かにミニゲームのほうが稼いでる。
True, you earned more from the mini-game.

2051
01:46:07,865 --> 01:46:10,565
おっと...ミニゲーム以下やばい。
Uh-oh... Making less than the mini-game is rough.

2052
01:46:10,565 --> 01:46:13,565
わしのほうが予想屋いける可能性ありじゃ。
There's a chance I could actually be a better tipster!

2053
01:46:13,465 --> 01:46:15,265
でも大事なのは...
But what matters is...

2054
01:46:15,565 --> 01:46:19,565
あ、まあね、そうそうそう、この試合ね、確かに確かに、この試合。
Ah, well yeah, right right right, this race, totally, totally, this race.

2055
01:46:20,065 --> 01:46:24,565
現在ですね、ホロプラスでアンケート実施中でございます、みなさん。
Right now, everyone, we are currently running a poll on HoloPlus.

2056
01:46:24,265 --> 01:46:27,565
あ、みんな来たぞ！来たぞみんな！
Ah, everyone's here! Here they come, everyone!

2057
01:46:25,565 --> 01:46:27,865
ご協力お願いいたしまーす！
Please participate!

2058
01:46:27,865 --> 01:46:32,265
それでは、角巻わためさんに来ていただきました。よろしくお願いいたしますー！
Now then, Tsunomaki Watame-san has joined us. Please take it away!

2059
01:46:31,565 --> 01:46:33,865
はい、よろしくお願いいたしまーす！
Yes, thank you for having me!

2060
01:46:32,565 --> 01:46:35,565
お願いしまーす！わため先輩だ！
Hello! It's Watame-senpai!

2061
01:46:35,565 --> 01:46:39,565
第2レースでも、あの、活躍されていたと思いますけれども...
I believe you did quite well in race 2 as well, but...

2062
01:46:39,565 --> 01:46:44,265
今回どうですか？勝て...まあ勝てない、あんまり勝てないと思いますけど...
How are things looking this time? Do you think you'll win... well, probably won't win much, though...

2063
01:46:43,565 --> 01:46:45,865
ちょっと！
Hey, wait a minute!

2064
01:46:47,265 --> 01:46:50,865
あれ、あれでしょ？本番で花開くということですよね？
That's how it goes, right? You're going to bloom in the real deal, right?

2065
01:46:51,065 --> 01:46:53,865
そうですね、ここで力を見せたいと思います！
That's right, I want to show my true strength here!

2066
01:46:53,865 --> 01:46:55,065
おおー！
Ooh!

2067
01:46:54,865 --> 01:47:01,865
分かりました！それでは角巻わためさんのですね、えー、注目馬、推奨馬をお願いいたします！
Understood! Then Tsunomaki Watame-san, please give us your notable horse, your recommended horse!

2068
01:47:02,065 --> 01:47:06,565
やっぱり今までキラキラしてるのが勝ってるので...
As expected, the horses that have been sparkling have been winning, so...

2069
01:47:06,565 --> 01:47:08,565
6...

2070
01:47:08,065 --> 01:47:11,565
柵の向こう...柵の向こうだ。
Behind the fence... It's behind the fence.

2071
01:47:10,565 --> 01:47:12,065
7...
and 7...

2072
01:47:11,865 --> 01:47:12,865
はい。
Yes.

2073
01:47:12,565 --> 01:47:16,565
6、7！シックスセブン！
6 and 7! Six, Seven!

2074
01:47:16,865 --> 01:47:19,065
予想家的には？
And from the tipster's perspective?

2075
01:47:18,565 --> 01:47:20,565
ちょっと...
Well...

2076
01:47:20,265 --> 01:47:21,565
なんですか？
What is it?

2077
01:47:21,565 --> 01:47:23,565
ソレハセコイダロ。
That's Cheap.

2078
01:47:23,065 --> 01:47:26,565
5！それはセコイだろ？！
Number 5! That's Cheap?!

2079
01:47:26,565 --> 01:47:30,565
それはセコイだろ。5か！
That's Cheap. Number 5, huh?!

2080
01:47:30,565 --> 01:47:34,565
セコ技で勝つんじゃないかなって...
I'm thinking maybe it'll win using some cheap trick...

2081
01:47:34,565 --> 01:47:39,265
ダジャレ...！ダジャレかい！
A pun...?! It's just a pun?!

2082
01:47:39,265 --> 01:47:42,065
よくないわ！言われる側ね！
That's no good! Sucks for the one being called that!

2083
01:47:41,865 --> 01:47:43,865
いけるんじゃないかなって...
I feel like it might just pull it off...

2084
01:47:43,865 --> 01:47:45,565
失速ですか？
Is it losing steam?

2085
01:47:45,265 --> 01:47:47,565
それ言われてるってことは...
If that's what's being said about it...

2086
01:47:47,565 --> 01:47:51,065
でもやる気はあるんだよ。やる気なさそうだったんで...
Though it does have motivation. Since it looked unmotivated before...

2087
01:47:51,065 --> 01:47:54,565
まあそうですね、キラキラはしてなかったですね。前走8着...
Well, true, it wasn't sparkling. Finished 8th in its previous race...

2088
01:47:54,565 --> 01:47:59,565
8着だったから...やる気ないんだよね...
Because it finished 8th... so it lacks motivation...

2089
01:48:00,265 --> 01:48:02,865
シルキーも気になります。
I'm also curious about Silky.

2090
01:48:02,865 --> 01:48:07,565
シルキーシャンドゥは前走4着、前々走4着と...
Silky Chandou was 4th in the previous race, and 4th the race before that...

2091
01:48:07,565 --> 01:48:13,565
まあ馬券内には来てないんですけれど、結構悔しい思いをしてるので、今回頑張ってくれるんじゃないかなとは思いますがね。
Well, it hasn't placed in the money, but having tasted that frustration, I think it might push hard this time.

2092
01:48:13,865 --> 01:48:16,065
馬の気持ち...
The horse's feelings...

2093
01:48:15,565 --> 01:48:17,565
馬の気持ち的に...
From the horse's perspective...

2094
01:48:17,565 --> 01:48:19,565
馬の気持ち的に。
From the horse's feelings.

2095
01:48:20,065 --> 01:48:23,065
気持ちやっぱ大事ですからね、馬の。
Feelings are really important after all, when it comes to horses.

2096
01:48:23,065 --> 01:48:25,065
そうですね。そうなのー？
Right. Is that so?

2097
01:48:25,565 --> 01:48:29,865
マガンホークアイに関しては、あの、これ私情じゃないですよ？
As for Magan Hawkeye, um, this isn't personal bias, okay?

2098
01:48:29,865 --> 01:48:33,065
二重丸！ルイ友だから！
Double circle! Because it's a Rui-tomo!

2099
01:48:33,065 --> 01:48:36,565
ルイ友の！
The Rui-tomo horse!

2100
01:48:36,565 --> 01:48:39,065
私情じゃないですけどね。
It really isn't personal bias, though.

2101
01:48:39,065 --> 01:48:46,065
ただ今回はちょっと、あのやる気に関してはキラキラの人達よりはもうちょっと、あんまりこう、落ち着いた感じでしたね。
It's just that this time, in terms of motivation, compared to the sparkling ones, it seemed a bit more subdued.

2102
01:48:46,065 --> 01:48:49,065
そうですね、キラキラの数的にも...
Indeed, in terms of sparkle count as well...

2103
01:48:49,565 --> 01:48:53,065
6は2キラ、7は4キラでした。
Number 6 had 2 sparkles, and number 7 had 4 sparkles.

2104
01:48:53,065 --> 01:48:57,265
ちなみにわためさんは何と何にじゃあ賭ける？
By the way, Watame-san, which ones are you going to bet on?

2105
01:48:57,265 --> 01:48:59,265
6-7！
6 and 7!

2106
01:48:59,265 --> 01:49:03,065
6-7！シックスセブン！
6 and 7! Six, Seven!

2107
01:49:03,065 --> 01:49:07,565
6-7！シックスセブン！
6 and 7! Six, Seven!

2108
01:49:07,565 --> 01:49:11,565
信じるも信じないも...みんな次第！
Whether you believe it or not... is up to you all!

