Mine is...

2967
02:35:09,669 --> 02:35:11,269
全部0円！
All 0 yen!

2968
02:35:11,369 --> 02:35:13,069
全部0円！
All 0 yen!

2969
02:35:13,569 --> 02:35:15,069
全部0円...
All 0 yen...

2970
02:35:15,269 --> 02:35:16,769
ヤバい！
This is bad!

2971
02:35:17,269 --> 02:35:18,869
見てお主ら。
Look, everyone.

2972
02:35:18,969 --> 02:35:20,269
わしの...
My...

2973
