直前に電波が落ちて大動揺していなくなりましたのじゃ。
Right before it, my connection dropped, I panicked completely, and vanished.

2992
02:36:21,869 --> 02:36:25,269
あの、回線落ちて、あの、入って...
Um, my line dropped, and then when I got back...

2993
02:36:25,369 --> 02:36:27,769
今日YouTube調子悪いからな、そういう日もあるよ。
YouTube's been acting up today, so days like that happen.

2994
02:36:27,869 --> 02:36:30,269
もうダメなのじゃ。紙切れになったのじゃ。
It was hopeless. It turned into scrap paper.

2995
