I can't take this anymore.

3001
02:36:47,069 --> 02:36:49,769
てか0円になってる人多そうじゃない？
Wait, doesn't it seem like a lot of people ended up at 0 yen?

3002
02:36:49,869 --> 02:36:51,269
みんな0円なんじゃない？
Isn't everyone at 0 yen?

3003
02:36:51,769 --> 02:36:54,269
