0 yen!

3006
02:36:56,469 --> 02:36:59,769
単勝で1賭けてた人とかがいけたか...
Maybe anyone who bet on 1 to Win pulled it off...

3007
02:37:00,269 --> 02:37:02,569
みんな0円か？
Is everyone at 0 yen?

3008
02:37:02,669 --> 02:37:05,069
