If you team up divine blessings with science...

3048
02:39:07,869 --> 02:39:09,269
マジかー、のじゃー。
Seriously... nojaa.

3049
02:39:09,369 --> 02:39:11,769
2人が組めば最強やからな。
If you two team up, you'll be unstoppable.

3050
02:39:11,869 --> 02:39:13,069
